  "summary": "The user-facing fluent API. Relation wraps an immutable RelationNode and each chainable method (filter, select via projection builder, join, join_asof, sort, head, group_by, unique, pivot, conform, sample, ...) returns a new Relation around a new node; terminals (collect, to_polars, to_pandas, to_pyarrow, to_dicts, item, count_rows, scalar aggregates, fingerprint, explain, snapshot) trigger compilation. It also provides relation()/concat() factories, GroupedRelation, materialization_scope checkpoint handles, and an optimisation pass registry.",
